## Getting started

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate        # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run the agent

```bash
python -m app.main "Calculate 25 * 4 and tell me what is AI"
```

## Run tests

```bash
pytest
```

## Adding custom tools

Register tools in `app/tools.py`:

```python
def my_tool(arg: str) -> str:
    return f"Processed: {arg}"

registry.register(Tool("my_tool", "Description of what it does", my_tool))
```
